WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.700
Real games have screens: a title, the game itself, and game over.

2
00:00:05.751 --> 00:00:09.501
A variable called state remembers which screen you are on.

3
00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:14.455
Pressing Play is an event, and it changes the state to play.

4
00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:22.552
Every five points, the level goes up and the turtle hops faster.

5
00:00:23.353 --> 00:00:27.653
It glides by taking one small step every 50 milliseconds.
